# ==================================================
# The Brisart Ecosystem
# ==================================================
# Freeze the vendored BSR2 files byte-for-byte on every platform. "-text"
# disables ALL line-ending conversion on checkin and checkout, so what Git
# stores is exactly what lands on disk on Windows, macOS, and Linux/CI alike --
# which is what makes the raw-byte SHA-256 pins in
# tests/test_bsr2_vendor_integrity.py match everywhere instead of only on the
# machine that produced them.
vendor/** -text

# Everything else: normal handling, checked out with LF so contributors and CI
# stay consistent. (Does not affect vendor/, overridden above.)
* text=auto eol=lf
